    },
    {
      "family": "daniels-channel",
      "rules": "team-(ask|answer|inbox|run-approved)|team-thread (T|archive)",
      "unprobed": "command-guard refuses every command these prefix rules match, and which layer refuses first is Claude Code's order, so the refused attempt daniels-channel and the hook attempt ask-path prove the refusal"
